{"text": "The accused man stepped into the arena and faced two doors, exactly alike and side by side. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had to open one of them, and no one could help him choose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind one door was a hungry tiger, the fiercest that could be found. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If he opened that door, the tiger would leap upon him at once as punishment for his guilt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind the other door was a lady, the most suitable one the king could find for him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If he opened this door, he would marry her right there, as a reward for his innocence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It did not matter whether he already had a wife or loved someone else. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The people loved these trials, because no one ever knew which result was coming. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They might see a terrible death or a happy wedding.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "a", "c", "c", "u", "s", "e", "d", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "s", "t", "e", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "a", "r", "e", "n", "a", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "a", "c", "e", "d", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", "s", ",", " ", "e", "x", "a", "c", "t", "l", "y", " ", "a", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "i", "d", "e", " ", "b", "y", " ", "s", "i", "d", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "n", "o", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "h", "e", "l", "p", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "c", "h", "o", "o", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "e", "h", "i", "n", "d", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", " ", "w